  "prefLabel": "Rev 203.07 Failure to Reply to Motion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 203.07 Failure to Reply to Motion. Failure to reply to a motion within the time allowed shall constitute a waiver of objection to the motion, but shall not in and of itself constitute grounds for granting the motion.\n\nSource. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06; ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev200.html"
